{"id":2094,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;以笔为媒溯红色根脉，以镜为窗传信仰力量！近日，纪念中国人民抗日战争胜利80周年暨红色印记寻访与礼敬专项活动之优秀调研报告评选、红色印记微视频大赛圆满落幕。活动期间，全校学子积极响应，深入寻访红色场馆、挖掘历史细节、讲述革命故事，形成了一批兼具思想深度、史实严谨性与艺术感染力的优秀成果，生动诠释了新时代青年对红色文化的传承与担当。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;经评审团综合评审，分别评选出各类奖项。具体获奖名单如下：</p><p>一、优秀调研报告评选获奖名单</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Uo7LnPLzN8LzGinSzTkUl7DM878MlLz8ozW2M7WfMRTknNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8U1yiUYhVLNMkUz7Pnm62ozUDoz7PnR9PnR-PLllsLRnFnmGbnR7YLlrFM4WVnm9Jv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYyDM4NagtA8pUlcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=6790&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/74B5CE2CBA11F7F946911D81D211E704/F09D121E/72EF8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Uo7LnPLzN8LzGinSzTkUl7DM878MlLz8ozW2M7WfMRTknNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8U1yiUYhVLNMkUz7Pnm62ozUDoz7PnR9PnR-PLllsLRnFnmGbnR7YLlrFM4WVnm9Jv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYyDM4NagtA8pUlcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=6790&e=.png\"></p><p>二、红色印记微视频大赛获奖名单</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnNLninm9DL4LaMSlUbL4W7LzWfM7VzVLRUanlU8LmrRnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiMYyDn1yaMmTVn7UaL4U4oR-4ozLinRCiL4vPM4VRLlWFn7rVnlU8U8VFMRWknzvJv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYyDM4NagtA8pUlcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=6790&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C576F069EDD0343823935D6537171C1B/DEEED4CA/42BE7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=UnNLninm9DL4LaMSlUbL4W7LzWfM7VzVLRUanlU8LmrRnNL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiMYyDn1yaMmTVn7UaL4U4oR-4ozLinRCiL4vPM4VRLlWFn7rVnlU8U8VFMRWknzvJv2bjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4LYyDM4NagtA8pUlcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1033&nid=6790&e=.png\"></p><p>公示时间为11月17日—11月21日。公示期间如有异议，请务必在11月21日下午18:00点前以书面或电话等方式向校团委反映。反映意见要求实名，内容客观真实，以便核实。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;联系人：王月花</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;联系电话：3922042</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 共青团中北大学委员会</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;